 evening runs through Sinatra's catalog with a full orchestra behind the v
 ocals. Because the museum sits on NAS Pensacola\, anyone 18 or older with
 out a DOD ID card has to file the museum's base-access form with Riley St
 ephens by October 9 to get on base for the show.\nPrice: not published by
